{
 "post_id": "var-hobbies-4",
 "slides": {
  "1": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "10/10 hobbies to make you",
      "extremely intelligent"
     ],
     "texte": "šios žiemos hobiai, nuo kurių smegenys tampa guvesnės"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "(neuroscience approved)"
     ],
     "texte": "(tai įrodyta)",
     "alignement": "droite"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_0d4b5e0e.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       1760,
       2368
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "2": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "train a martial art"
     ],
     "texte": "užsirašyk į [[vakarinius kursus]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "you get corrected constantly, exposed when your",
      "technique is bad, and forced to keep going when",
      "you're tired"
     ],
     "texte": "istorija, astronomija, teisė: tikras dėstytojas, tikri klausimai ir [[kas savaitę kažkam pasiruošti]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "martial arts teaches",
      "you to stay calm under",
      "pressure"
     ],
     "texte": "kursai suaugus siejami su [[mažesne demencijos rizika]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "instead of quitting the",
      "second something gets",
      "uncomfortable"
     ],
     "texte": "ir jie ištraukia tave iš namų, [[kai 17 val. jau tamsu]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_457366c6.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2496,
       1664
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "3": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "never miss twice"
     ],
     "texte": "daryk [[jogą]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "missed the gym today? fine. ate badly? move on.",
      "wasted three hours scrolling? don't waste the next",
      "three."
     ],
     "texte": "išlaikyti pozą, sekti kvėpavimą, tęsti nežiūrint į trenerį: smegenys visą valandą [[lieka prie vieno dalyko]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "the real damage isn't",
      "making a mistake."
     ],
     "texte": "8 savaitės: [[geresnė atmintis]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "it's using that mistake as",
      "permission to keep going."
     ],
     "texte": "o kilimėlis telpa [[tavo kambaryje]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_05c19636.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "4": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "study longer than you want to"
     ],
     "texte": "kas mėnesį eik [[į muziejų]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "the useful part usually starts when your brain",
      "wants to quit"
     ],
     "texte": "išsirink vieną paveikslą ir [[žiūrėk į jį 10 minučių]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "stay for another",
      "20–30 minutes",
      "after you feel",
      "bored, distracted,",
      "or restless"
     ],
     "texte": "dažnai muziejus lankantiems po 10 metų [[mažesnė demencijos rizika]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "you're not just learning the subject, you're training",
      "yourself to keep going when motivation disappears"
     ],
     "texte": "išeini su istorija, dailininko vardu ir klausimu, ir tai [[daug geriau už skrolinimą]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_f8c4c2ab.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       1664,
       2496
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "5": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "stop announcing your plans"
     ],
     "texte": "kilnok [[svarmenis]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "telling everyone your goals can give you a hit of",
      "dopamine before you've actually done anything"
     ],
     "texte": "pritūpimai, mirties trauka: skaičiuoti, laikytis technikos, [[tęsti, kai dega]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "you get to feel",
      "ambitious, receive",
      "praise, and imagine",
      "the end result",
      "without putting in",
      "the work"
     ],
     "texte": "vyresniems žmonėms 6 mėnesiai jėgos treniruočių [[apsaugojo atminties zoną]] iki metų po to"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "stop talking about what you're going to do. disappear,",
      "put your head down, and let your results speak for you"
     ],
     "texte": "užtenka dviejų treniruočių per savaitę, o sporto salė bent jau [[šildoma]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_12812cb9.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       1760,
       2368
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "6": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "read books instead of scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "pasistatyk [[atminties rūmus]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "a book makes you follow one idea for pages.",
      "scrolling trains that out of your head"
     ],
     "texte": "įsivaizduok savo butą ir kiekvieną dalyką, kurį reikia prisiminti, padėk [[į kambarį]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "if you want to think",
      "deeper, give your brain",
      "something long before",
      "anything short"
     ],
     "texte": "per 6 savaites pradedantieji [[daugiau nei dvigubai]] padidino įsimintų žodžių skaičių"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "i use readup which blocks",
      "my apps until i read for 20",
      "minutes, which stopps me",
      "from scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "kas šią žiemą pakeitė mano skrolinimą: joga, muziejus ir Renesansas per 5 min. [[programėlėje Sophia]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": "sophia_capture",
    "I2": "sophia_appstore"
